  <h1 class="page-title">Claude Pro vs Max 5x vs Max 20x: Token Limits, Real Capacity & CFO Seat Planning</h1>
  <p class="updated">Subscription Analysis · 21 October 2026</p>
  <p class="byline">By the LLM CFO team</p>

  <p class="lede">Anthropic sells three subscription tiers — Pro ($20), Max 5x ($100), Max 20x ($200) — but publishes no fixed token quotas. This guide translates opaque "× capacity" marketing into API-equivalent dollars, burst behavior, and seat-planning math for finance and engineering leaders.</p>

