  <h2>Bottom Line for CFOs</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Max 5x ($100) is the default</strong> for engineers who code daily with AI. It pays for itself if it saves ≥2 hours/month at $50/hr.</li>
    <li><strong>Max 20x ($200) is a specialization tool</strong> — buy it for the 10–20% of engineers doing heavy agentic work, not the whole team.</li>
    <li><strong>Never assume subscription = API replacement.</strong> Automation, CI/CD, and backend services need separate API budget.</li>
    <li><strong>Track utilization.</strong> An unused Max 20x seat is the most expensive idle software license in your stack.</li>
  </ul>